Package: shinygridtools
Title: Grid Entry and Baskets for 'shinyformtools' Forms
Version: 0.3.2
Authors@R:
    person("Georg", "Wiegleb", , "gwiestat@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Enter many related records of a 'shinyformtools' form at once in
    a spreadsheet-like grid. 'grid_input()' is a grid of number cells as a
    'Shiny' input and as a field type: keyboard navigation, block paste from a
    spreadsheet, live sums. 'grid_server()' shows the records of a group as a
    grid, one record per row (wide) or per cell (long), and saves the cells
    the user changed in one transaction, with a per-cell check against other
    users' changes and their entries shown every few seconds. 'cart_input()'
    is a basket field: items dragged from a palette whose stock is shared
    by every basket, checked on every save, with a board that moves pieces
    between records. Built on the extension API of 'shinyformtools'.
URL: https://github.com/Gwstat/shinygridtools
BugReports: https://github.com/Gwstat/shinygridtools/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0),
    shinyformtools (>= 0.10.0)
